levels 1-12
zone map 2521
faction Horde
race Skyborne
folder Nood Guide
why Levels 1-12 starting-zone guide. Coordinates follow the WoW Forever client data and quests follow Wowhead Forever, with WoW Forever's new quests and new race/class combos (Orc Mage, Troll Warlock, Undead Paladin, Skyborne) added…
